"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44010018\" data-end-ref=\"44010018\">18</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44010032\" data-end-ref=\"44010032\">32</data> <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44021016\" data-end-ref=\"44021016\">21:16</data>.</div> <div class=\"as-sense\" data-n=\"2.\"><span class=\"as-sense-n\">2.</span> In late writers (Polyb., al.; II Mac 9:6), <i class=\"as-gloss\">to surprise</i>, <i class=\"as-gloss\">astonish</i> by strangeness: <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44017020\" data-end-ref=\"44017020\">Ac 17:20</data>; pass., <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"60004004\" data-end-ref=\"60004004\">I Pe 4:4</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"60004012\" data-end-ref=\"60004012\">12</data>.†</div> </div>",
