"content": "<style> .as-entry { font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif; line-height: 1.55; } .as-entry .greek { font-family: \"SBL Greek\", \"Gentium Plus\", \"Times New Roman\", serif; } .as-entry .hebrew, .as-entry .aramaic { font-family: \"SBL Hebrew\", \"Ezra SIL\", \"Times New Roman\", serif; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: isolate; } .as-entry .latin { font-style: italic; } .as-entry .as-head { margin: 0 0 0.6em; } .as-entry .as-shared { color: #333; } .as-entry .as-orth { font-size: 1.1em; } .as-entry .as-gloss, .as-entry .as-emph { font-style: italic; } .as-entry .as-pos, .as-entry .as-subc, .as-entry .as-usg { font-style: italic; } .as-entry .as-sense { margin: 0.45em 0 0.45em 1.1em; } .as-entry .as-sense .as-sense { padding-left: 0.6em; border-left: 2px solid #d8d4c8; } .as-entry .as-sense-n { font-weight: bold; margin-right: 0.25em; } .as-entry .as-re { margin: 0.6em 0 0; } .as-entry .ref, .as-entry .xref { white-space: nowrap; } </style> <div class=\"as-entry\" data-page=\"307\"> <p class=\"as-head\"><span class=\"as-form\"><b class=\"as-orth greek\" lang=\"grc\">ξένος</b>, <span class=\"greek\" lang=\"grc\">-η, -ον</span>,</span> <span class=\"as-etym\"> <span class=\"as-lxx\">[in LXX chiefly for <span class=\"hebrew\" lang=\"he\" data-strongs=\"H5237\">נׇכְרִי</span>;]</span> </span></p> <div class=\"as-sense\"><div class=\"as-sense\" data-n=\"(a)\"><span class=\"as-sense-n\">(a)</span> <i class=\"as-gloss\">foreign</i>, <i class=\"as-gloss\">alien</i>: <span class=\"greek\" lang=\"grc\">δαιμόνια</span>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44017018\" data-end-ref=\"44017018\">Ac 17:18</data>; <span class=\"greek\" lang=\"grc\">διδαχαί</span>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"58013009\" data-end-ref=\"58013009\">He 13:9</data>;</div> <div class=\"as-sense\" data-n=\"(b)\"><span class=\"as-sense-n\">(b)</span> c. gen. rei, <i class=\"as-gloss\">strange to</i>, <i class=\"as-gloss\">estranged from</i>, <i class=\"as-gloss\">ignorant of </i>: <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"49002012\" data-end-ref=\"49002012\">Eph 2:12</data>;</div> <div class=\"as-sense\" data-n=\"(c)\"><span class=\"as-sense-n\">(c)</span> <i class=\"as-gloss\">strange</i>, <i class=\"as-gloss\">unusual</i>: <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"60004012\" data-end-ref=\"60004012\">I Pe 4:12</data>.</div></div> <div class=\"as-sense\">As subst., <span class=\"greek\" lang=\"grc\">ὁ ξ.</span>, <div class=\"as-sense\" data-n=\"(a)\"><span class=\"as-sense-n\">(a)</span> <i class=\"as-gloss\">a foreigner</i>, <i class=\"as-gloss\">stranger</i>: <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40025035\" data-end-ref=\"40025035\">Mt 25:35</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40025038\" data-end-ref=\"40025038\">38</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40025043\" data-end-ref=\"40025043\">43</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40025044\" data-end-ref=\"40025044\">44</data> <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40027007\" data-end-ref=\"40027007\">27:7</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44017021\" data-end-ref=\"44017021\">Ac 17:21</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"64001005\" data-end-ref=\"64001005\">III Jo 5</data>; <span class=\"greek\" lang=\"grc\">ξένοι κ. τάροικοι</span> (opp. to <span class=\"greek\" lang=\"grc\">συμπολῖται</span>, <span class=\"greek\" lang=\"grc\">οίκεῖοι</span>), <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"49002019\" data-end-ref=\"49002019\">Eph 2:19</data>; <span class=\"greek\" lang=\"grc\">ξ. καὶ παρεπίδημοι</span>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"58011013\" data-end-ref=\"58011013\">He 11:13</data>;</div> <div class=\"as-sense\" data-n=\"(b)\"><span class=\"as-sense-n\">(b)</span> one of the parties bound by ties of hospitality; <div class=\"as-sense\" data-n=\"α\"><span class=\"as-sense-n\">α</span> <i class=\"as-gloss\">the guest</i>;</div> <div class=\"as-sense\" data-n=\"β\"><span class=\"as-sense-n\">β</span> <i class=\"as-gloss\">the host</i> ( = <span class=\"greek\" lang=\"grc\">ξενοδόκος</span>, Hom., <i class=\"as-emph\">Il.</i>, xv, 532): <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"45016023\" data-end-ref=\"45016023\">Ro 16:23</data>.†</div></div></div> </div>",
