"content": "<style> .as-entry { font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif; line-height: 1.55; } .as-entry .greek { font-family: \"SBL Greek\", \"Gentium Plus\", \"Times New Roman\", serif; } .as-entry .hebrew, .as-entry .aramaic { font-family: \"SBL Hebrew\", \"Ezra SIL\", \"Times New Roman\", serif; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: isolate; } .as-entry .latin { font-style: italic; } .as-entry .as-head { margin: 0 0 0.6em; } .as-entry .as-shared { color: #333; } .as-entry .as-orth { font-size: 1.1em; } .as-entry .as-gloss, .as-entry .as-emph { font-style: italic; } .as-entry .as-pos, .as-entry .as-subc, .as-entry .as-usg { font-style: italic; } .as-entry .as-sense { margin: 0.45em 0 0.45em 1.1em; } .as-entry .as-sense .as-sense { padding-left: 0.6em; border-left: 2px solid #d8d4c8; } .as-entry .as-sense-n { font-weight: bold; margin-right: 0.25em; } .as-entry .as-re { margin: 0.6em 0 0; } .as-entry .ref, .as-entry .xref { white-space: nowrap; } </style> <div class=\"as-entry\" data-page=\"308\"> <p class=\"as-head\"><span class=\"as-form\">**† <b class=\"as-orth greek\" lang=\"grc\">ξέστης</b>, <span class=\"greek\" lang=\"grc\">-ου, ὁ</span></span> <span class=\"as-etym\"> <span class=\"as-derivation\">(a Sicilian corruption of Lat. <span class=\"latin\" lang=\"la\">sextarius</span>),</span> <span class=\"as-lxx\">[in Al.: <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"03014010\" data-end-ref=\"03014010\">Le 14:10</data> (<span class=\"hebrew\" lang=\"he\" data-strongs=\"H3849\">לֹג</span>, LXX <span class=\"greek\" lang=\"grc\">κοτύλη</span>)*;]</span> </span></p> <div class=\"as-sense\" data-n=\"1.\"><span class=\"as-sense-n\">1.</span> <i class=\"as-gloss\">a sextarius</i> (about a pint).</div> <div class=\"as-sense\" data-n=\"2.\"><span class=\"as-sense-n\">2.</span> In NT, <i class=\"as-gloss\">a pitcher</i> of wood or stone: <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"41007004\" data-end-ref=\"41007004\">Mk 7:4</data>.†</div> </div>",
