"content": "<style> .as-entry { font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif; line-height: 1.55; } .as-entry .greek { font-family: \"SBL Greek\", \"Gentium Plus\", \"Times New Roman\", serif; } .as-entry .hebrew, .as-entry .aramaic { font-family: \"SBL Hebrew\", \"Ezra SIL\", \"Times New Roman\", serif; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: isolate; } .as-entry .latin { font-style: italic; } .as-entry .as-head { margin: 0 0 0.6em; } .as-entry .as-shared { color: #333; } .as-entry .as-orth { font-size: 1.1em; } .as-entry .as-gloss, .as-entry .as-emph { font-style: italic; } .as-entry .as-pos, .as-entry .as-subc, .as-entry .as-usg { font-style: italic; } .as-entry .as-sense { margin: 0.45em 0 0.45em 1.1em; } .as-entry .as-sense .as-sense { padding-left: 0.6em; border-left: 2px solid #d8d4c8; } .as-entry .as-sense-n { font-weight: bold; margin-right: 0.25em; } .as-entry .as-re { margin: 0.6em 0 0; } .as-entry .ref, .as-entry .xref { white-space: nowrap; } </style> <div class=\"as-entry\" data-page=\"308\"> <p class=\"as-head\"><span class=\"as-form\"><b class=\"as-orth greek\" lang=\"grc\">ξηραίνω</b></span> <span class=\"as-etym\"> <span class=\"as-derivation\">(&lt; <span class=\"greek\" lang=\"grc\">ξηρός</span>),</span> <span class=\"as-lxx\">[in LXX chiefly for <span class=\"hebrew\" lang=\"he\" data-strongs=\"H3001\">יָבֵשׁ</span>;]</span> </span></p> <div class=\"as-sense\"><i class=\"as-gloss\">to dry up</i>, <i class=\"as-gloss\">parch</i>, <i class=\"as-gloss\">wither</i>. c. acc., <span class=\"greek\" lang=\"grc\">τ. χόρτον</span>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"59001011\" data-end-ref=\"59001011\">Ja 1:11</data>; pass., <i class=\"as-gloss\">to become</i> or <i class=\"as-gloss\">be dry</i> or <i class=\"as-gloss\">withered</i>: of plants, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40013006\" data-end-ref=\"40013006\">Mt 13:6</data> <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40021019\" data-end-ref=\"40021019\">21:19</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40021020\" data-end-ref=\"40021020\">20</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"41004006\" data-end-ref=\"41004006\">Mk 4:6</data> <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"41011020\" data-end-ref=\"41011020\">11:20</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"41011021\" data-end-ref=\"41011021\">21</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42008006\" data-end-ref=\"42008006\">Lk 8:6</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"43015006\" data-end-ref=\"43015006\">Jo 15:6</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"60001024\" data-end-ref=\"60001024\">I Pe 1:24</data>; of ripened crops, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66014015\" data-end-ref=\"66014015\">Re 14:15</data>; of liquids, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"41005029\" data-end-ref=\"41005029\">Mk 5:29</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66016012\" data-end-ref=\"66016012\">Re 16:12</data>; of members of the body, <i class=\"as-gloss\">to waste away</i>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"41003001\" data-end-ref=\"41003001\">Mk 3:1</data> (cf. <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"11013004\" data-end-ref=\"11013004\">III Ki 13:4</data>) <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"41009018\" data-end-ref=\"41009018\">9:18</data>.†</div> </div>",
