"41003003\" data-end-ref=\"41003003\">Mk 3:3</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42006006\" data-end-ref=\"42006006\">Lk 6:6</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42006008\" data-end-ref=\"42006008\">8</data>; of the dry land, <span class=\"greek\" lang=\"grc\">ἡ ξηρά</span> (sc. <span class=\"greek\" lang=\"grc\">γῆ</span>, cf. <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01001009\" data-end-ref=\"01001009\">Ge 1:9</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01001010\" data-end-ref=\"01001010\">10</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"32001009\" data-end-ref=\"32001009\">Jh 1:19</data>, al.): <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40023015\" data-end-ref=\"40023015\">Mt 23:15</data>; <span class=\"greek\" lang=\"grc\">γῆ</span>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"58011029\" data-end-ref=\"58011029\">He 11:29</data>.†</div> </div>",
